This package is generated from the Cofounder monorepo (packages/modules/*/files).
It contains no third-party source code. The apps that install it pull their own
npm dependencies (next, react, viem, wagmi, zod, jose, @supabase/supabase-js…),
each under its own license.

This package holds code only. It contains no keys, tokens or other secrets:
every secret an app needs is read from that app's own environment variables.
